			<item>
				<title>Why Your Best Thinking Needs a Bigger Page</title>
				<link>http://localhost:3001/reviews/leuchtturm-master/</link>
				<pubDate>Mon, 02 Feb 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
				<guid>http://localhost:3001/reviews/leuchtturm-master/</guid>
				<description>&lt;aside class=&#34;takeaways&#34;&gt;&#xA;  &lt;p class=&#34;takeaways-h&#34;&gt;The 30-second verdict&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;  &lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;A4+ pages give you room to actually mind-map instead of cramping notes.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;100 g/m² paper resists fountain-ink bleed-through and ghosting.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Numbered pages plus a real index turn a year of notes into a reference.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Lay-flat thread binding survives constant open-and-close.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&#xA;  &#xA;  &lt;a class=&#34;btn btn-primary&#34; href=&#34;https://www.amazon.com/s?k=Leuchtturm1917&amp;#43;Master&amp;#43;Slim&amp;#43;A4&amp;#43;Hardcover&amp;#43;Notebook&amp;amp;tag=csuitnec-20&amp;amp;linkCode=ll2&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;sponsored nofollow noopener&#34; data-affiliate=&#34;Leuchtturm1917 Master Slim A4&amp;#43; Notebook&#34; data-cta=&#34;takeaways&#34;&gt;Check Price on Amazon&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;  &lt;a class=&#34;takeaways-jump&#34; href=&#34;#full-review&#34;&gt;Or read the full breakdown ↓&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;  &#xA;&lt;/aside&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;small-pages-force-small-thinking&#34;&gt;Small pages force small thinking&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;A pocket notebook is fine for a to-do list. It&amp;rsquo;s the wrong tool for laying out an org chart, a deal structure or a quarter&amp;rsquo;s priorities on one visible surface. The Master Slim gives you a full oversized sheet, so the whole picture stays in view. See the ruling options (dotted is the flexible choice) on &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.amazon.com/s?k=Leuchtturm1917&amp;#43;Master&amp;#43;Slim&amp;#43;A4&amp;#43;Hardcover&amp;#43;Notebook&amp;amp;tag=csuitnec-20&amp;amp;linkCode=ll2&#34; class=&#34;out aff&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;sponsored nofollow noopener&#34; data-affiliate=&#34;Leuchtturm1917 Master Slim A4&amp;#43; Notebook&#34; data-cta=&#34;in-content&#34;&gt;Amazon&lt;svg class=&#34;out-ico&#34; width=&#34;12&#34; height=&#34;12&#34; viewBox=&#34;0 0 24 24&#34; aria-hidden=&#34;true&#34;&gt;&lt;path d=&#34;M7 17 17 7M9 7h8v8&#34; fill=&#34;none&#34; stroke=&#34;currentColor&#34; stroke-width=&#34;2.5&#34; stroke-linecap=&#34;round&#34; stroke-linejoin=&#34;round&#34;/&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
